// =============================================================================
//  DelphiRtl.cs  -  Delphi RTL / VCL compatibility layer for converted projects
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  Generated by "Delphi to WPF Converter" (C-TEC). This file is copied into
//  every converted project. It lets translated Delphi code keep calling the
//  routines it knows (IntToStr, Copy, Pos, ShowMessage, FormatDateTime ...)
//  and gives VCL-like access to WPF controls (Memo1.Lines, ListBox1.Items,
//  Caption, Visible ...) without hand-rewriting every statement.
//
//  Semantics deliberately follow Delphi:
//   * strings are 1-based in Copy/Pos/Delete/Insert,
//   * TDateTime is a double (days since 1899-12-30, the OLE Automation date),
//   * Round uses banker's rounding, Trunc truncates toward zero,
//   * forms closed with the X button are hidden (caHide) unless they are the
//     main form - so auto-created forms can be shown again like in Delphi.
//
//  You are free to edit this file. Over time, replace calls to it with
//  idiomatic .NET code where it makes sense.
// =============================================================================

